11:48.120 --> 11:50.370
just make a cheat sheet, some sticky notes

11:50.370 --> 11:53.580
to remind yourself of the five or six commands that we cover

11:53.580 --> 11:54.930
and stick 'em on your computer

11:54.930 --> 11:56.730
and just look at that if needed.

11:56.730 --> 11:58.800
Anyway, that's the basics of navigation.

11:58.800 --> 12:02.970
We covered ls for list, pwd for print working directory,

12:02.970 --> 12:05.160
and CD for change directory.

12:05.160 --> 12:08.040
cd.. backs out one folder

12:08.040 --> 12:11.100
